skills/domains/cwow-*/
skills/domains/*/knowledge/
kg-infrastructure/docs/CWOW_*
kg-infrastructure/docs/SNF_*
kg-infrastructure/postgres-graph/INGEST_*_DOMAIN.md

# Broken/backup source snapshots
*.broken
*.bak[0-9]*

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints

